erables

{{jsxref("String")}}, {{jsxref("Array")}}, {{jsxref("TypedArray")}}, {{jsxref("Map")}} and {{jsxref("Set")}} are all built-in iterables, because their prototype objects all have a {{jsxref("Symbol.iterator")}} method.

